      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keine Kalender gefunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select all" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alle auswählen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select none" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keinen auswählen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendars used for meal planning" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kalender für die Essensplanung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is used until you pick a calendar here. New calendars are never added on their own." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es wird nichts genutzt, bis du hier einen Kalender auswählst. Neue Kalender kommen nie von selbst dazu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendar detail" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kalender-Details"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Privacy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Privatsphäre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Event notes, invitees, locations and links are never read, shown or stored." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notizen, Teilnehmende, Orte und Links von Terminen werden nie gelesen, gezeigt oder gespeichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Meal times" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Essenszeiten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only events near a meal’s time are considered, so a day’s full calendar never lands in your plan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es zählen nur Termine rund um die Zeit einer Mahlzeit – nie der ganze Tageskalender."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nobody" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Niemand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whose calendar is this?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wem gehört dieser Kalender?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. When you say who a calendar belongs to, the plan can show who is still busy around a meal. MealPlan never guesses this from calendar names." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional. Wenn du angibst, wem ein Kalender gehört, kann der Plan zeigen, wer rund um eine Mahlzeit noch beschäftigt ist. MealPlan rät das nie anhand von Kalendernamen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bis"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the standard times" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standardzeiten verwenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Events between %1$@ and %2$@ count towards this meal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termine zwischen %1$@ und %2$@ zählen zu dieser Mahlzeit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows the schedule around each meal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeigt den Tagesablauf rund um jede Mahlzeit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People are free at different times." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Personen sind zu unterschiedlichen Zeiten frei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From the calendars you chose for meal planning. MealPlan never changes your calendar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus den Kalendern, die du für die Essensplanung ausgewählt hast. MealPlan ändert deinen Kalender nie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@: free from %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@: frei ab %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld events around %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
